Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.54,0:00:10.10,Generic,Members,0,0,0,,Sketch!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.09,0:00:13.87,Generic,Members,0,0,0,,If the manager's no good, neither are the part-timers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.82,0:00:19.48,Generic,Members,0,0,0,,Busy, busy, busy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.30,0:00:23.06,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Register—please wait a moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.08,0:00:30.16,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Hey, so lately I spotted this cute HKT48 member girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.68,0:00:32.47,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Who was it? I forget her name.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.54,0:00:33.37,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,I might know!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.44,0:00:34.69,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Nakano Minami?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.76,0:00:35.61,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,No no,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.68,0:00:36.47,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,totally wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.54,0:00:38.13,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Isn't it Matsunaga Yui?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.20,0:00:40.07,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,That's probably definitely wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.14,0:00:41.49,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Doesn't even graze it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.56,0:00:44.99,Generic,Manager,0,0,0,,Hey, everyone—why are you chatting like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.06,0:00:46.63,Generic,Manager,0,0,0,,We're this busy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.70,0:00:50.28,Generic,Manager,0,0,0,,If you don't work too, I won't be able to pay your wages!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.02,0:00:54.37,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Manager! A customer is waiting at the register!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.44,0:00:55.64,Generic,Manager,0,0,0,,Oh, thanks—I'll go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.44,0:00:58.85,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Man, the manager is such an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.92,0:01:01.69,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Exactly—that's why we end up working for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.76,0:01:04.26,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Right? He's ridiculously gullible, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.94,0:01:05.84,Generic,Customer,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.76,0:01:11.12,Generic,Customer,0,0,0,,Where is the manager?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.08,0:01:14.89,Generic,Manager,0,0,0,,I'm the manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.96,0:01:16.15,Generic,Customer,0,0,0,,Ah, Manager—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.22,0:01:19.27,Generic,Customer,0,0,0,,Um, someone took a bite out of my bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.34,0:01:22.23,Generic,Manager,0,0,0,,Whoa, you're right—the bread's been nibbled!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.30,0:01:23.40,Generic,Customer,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.84,0:01:25.75,Generic,Manager,0,0,0,,Why…? Maybe someone was hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.82,0:01:29.66,Generic,Manager,0,0,0,,Customer, truly, I'm so sorry about this—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.54,0:01:31.34,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Ehh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.52,0:01:32.81,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Wait—Yui ate this, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.88,0:01:33.75,Generic,Yui,0,0,0,,Absolutely not!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.82,0:01:35.83,Generic,Yui,0,0,0,,No way—I only eat mentaiko French bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.90,0:01:36.14,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.54,0:01:38.19,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,You've got something on you—Hiiko-pan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.26,0:01:38.72,Generic,Hiiro,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.48,0:01:40.17,Generic,Hiiro,0,0,0,,I ate it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.24,0:01:41.09,Generic,Members,0,0,0,,You ate it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.16,0:01:42.58,Generic,Hiiro,0,0,0,,I ate it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.65,0:01:43.25,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.32,0:01:44.29,Generic,Hiiro,0,0,0,,Because it looked so good…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.36,0:01:47.85,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,But if it looked good and you ate it, what's done is done, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.92,0:01:49.43,Generic,Hiiro,0,0,0,,So… keep it a secret for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.50,0:01:49.76,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.83,0:01:51.19,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Got it—we're best friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.26,0:01:52.99,Generic,Hiiro,0,0,0,,Yeah—us, forever…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.06,0:01:54.18,Generic,Members,0,0,0,,Forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.84,0:01:55.82,Generic,Manager,0,0,0,,I'm truly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.32,0:01:57.62,Generic,Manager,0,0,0,,One moment, please—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.58,0:01:58.90,Generic,Manager,0,0,0,,Hey—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.12,0:02:02.72,Generic,Manager,0,0,0,,Someone took a bite of the customer's bread?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.08,0:02:04.21,Generic,Members,0,0,0,,We don't know anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.28,0:02:05.51,Generic,Manager,0,0,0,,Who ate it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.58,0:02:06.40,Generic,Members,0,0,0,,No idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.60,0:02:08.20,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Wait—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.00,0:02:10.21,Generic,Hiiro,0,0,0,,I thought we'd be forever—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.28,0:02:11.89,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,You've got crumbs stuck on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.96,0:02:13.06,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Oh, you're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.13,0:02:15.12,Generic,Yui,0,0,0,,Like, Hiiko-pan was going "uma-pan! uma-pan!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.19,0:02:15.82,Generic,Hiiro,0,0,0,,Uma-pan?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.89,0:02:16.92,Generic,Hiiro,0,0,0,,I didn't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.99,0:02:18.48,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Uma-pan—you ARE eating bread!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.55,0:02:19.77,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,We had a promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.74,0:02:23.99,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Whoa, those crumbs are huge—you ate a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.06,0:02:26.05,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,But well… you were hungry, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.12,0:02:27.31,Generic,Hiiro,0,0,0,,I was starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.38,0:02:27.74,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.81,0:02:30.11,Generic,Manager,0,0,0,,Well, what's done is done,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.18,0:02:34.53,Generic,Manager,0,0,0,,but if you apologize sincerely, most things get forgiven.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.60,0:02:35.19,Generic,Hiiro,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.26,0:02:36.83,Generic,Manager,0,0,0,,So let's go apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.90,0:02:37.34,Generic,Hiiro,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.41,0:02:39.24,Generic,Customer,0,0,0,,I already heard everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.58,0:02:42.68,Generic,Manager,0,0,0,,This girl ate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.18,0:02:44.64,Generic,Customer,0,0,0,,Why did you eat it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.24,0:02:46.78,Generic,Hiiro,0,0,0,,Because it looked delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.78,0:02:50.02,Generic,Manager,0,0,0,,And so, valued customer, regarding this matter—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.36,0:02:51.38,Generic,Manager,0,0,0,,I'm truly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.92,0:02:53.02,Generic,Manager,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.44,0:02:56.29,Generic,Customer,0,0,0,,Don't "sorry" me—we're not friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.36,0:02:58.15,Generic,Customer,0,0,0,,Someone ate my bread!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.22,0:02:59.78,Generic,Manager,0,0,0,,You're right—seriously, my bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.16,0:03:01.88,Generic,Manager,0,0,0,,Like, for real, seriously sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.92,0:03:04.57,Generic,Customer,0,0,0,,This shop should just go under!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.64,0:03:06.96,Generic,Manager,0,0,0,,Huh? 'Go under'?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.50,0:03:08.89,Generic,Manager,0,0,0,,Everyone, assemble!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.96,0:03:09.40,Generic,Members,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.89,0:03:12.90,Generic,Manager,0,0,0,,A customer just told us to go under,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.97,0:03:14.59,Generic,Manager,0,0,0,,so this shop will be closing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.21,0:03:16.62,Generic,Manager,0,0,0,,So—farewell party time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.80,0:03:17.35,Generic,Members,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.42,0:03:21.04,Generic,Members,0,0,0,,Yay! The shop went under—we're so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.86,0:03:22.24,Generic,Members,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.00,0:03:24.23,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,I'll try not to mess up—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.30,0:03:25.82,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,I'll give the show my all!

Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.33,0:24:57.84,Default,Host,0,0,0,,From here, please introduce yourselves one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.91,0:25:00.58,Default,Host,0,0,0,,Today's topic is: something that made you laugh recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.65,0:25:02.23,Default,Host,0,0,0,,Ikuno-chan, please go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.13,0:25:07.24,Default,Ikuno-chan,0,0,0,,Hi. I'm Ikuno Rina from Team H—14, a third-year junior-high student from Fukuoka.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.31,0:25:08.05,Default,Ikuno-chan,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.45,0:25:09.23,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Ikuno!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.35,0:25:12.95,Default,Ikuno-chan,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.21,0:25:17.63,Default,Ikuno-chan,0,0,0,,Something that made me laugh recently involves Amiyun.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.49,0:25:22.78,Default,Ikuno-chan,0,0,0,,We've been together a lot lately—there was even a whole week we kept meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.85,0:25:25.57,Default,Ikuno-chan,0,0,0,,We were hanging out then.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.23,0:25:29.39,Default,Ikuno-chan,0,0,0,,On the way to the station she tripped like ten times,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.09,0:25:34.27,Default,Ikuno-chan,0,0,0,,with such spectacular trips that we burst out laughing—and we sync up so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.85,0:25:38.89,Default,Ikuno-chan,0,0,0,,We even say the same things at the same time, so we laugh a lot,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.67,0:25:44.12,Default,Ikuno-chan,0,0,0,,but I only remember the broad strokes—we really laugh at tiny things,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.19,0:25:46.57,Default,Ikuno-chan,0,0,0,,so honestly I don't remember exactly why we were laughing,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.95,0:25:49.56,Default,Ikuno-chan,0,0,0,,but I want to keep getting along with Amiyun.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.63,0:25:51.17,Default,Ikuno-chan,0,0,0,,Please look after me today.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.81,0:25:59.31,Default,Host,0,0,0,,When I point the mic: Minami! When I point at Minami: "South seat," please!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.26,0:26:04.42,Default,Mii-na,0,0,0,,East, west, south, north—my favorite direction is Minami (south)!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.20,0:26:07.72,Default,Host,0,0,0,,Apartment hunting? Minami-no-ki!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.22,0:26:10.81,Default,Mii-na,0,0,0,,Looking for cuties? South seat!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.88,0:26:14.83,Default,Mii-na,0,0,0,,I'm Mii-na—Nakano Minami—16, from Fukuoka.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.90,0:26:15.71,Default,Mii-na,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.78,0:26:16.86,Default,Mii-na,0,0,0,,Minami!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.66,0:26:18.26,Default,Mii-na,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.08,0:26:27.06,Default,Mii-na,0,0,0,,Something that made me laugh recently was at an online talk event the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.58,0:26:30.76,Default,Mii-na,0,0,0,,The fans who came were all so funny,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.24,0:26:33.72,Default,Mii-na,0,0,0,,and everyone was laughing so hard at each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.06,0:26:35.63,Default,Mii-na,0,0,0,,cracking up,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.70,0:26:37.59,Default,Mii-na,0,0,0,,so I want to laugh even more from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.66,0:26:39.20,Default,Mii-na,0,0,0,,Please look after me today.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.54,0:26:40.94,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.47,0:26:46.57,Default,Host,0,0,0,,When Yui points the mic: mentaiko French bread and Yui-pan, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.89,0:26:49.59,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,The bread Yui likes is…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.01,0:26:55.08,Default,Yui,0,0,0,,The bread I love is Yui-pan!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.98,0:26:56.58,Default,Yui,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.68,0:26:59.11,Default,Host,0,0,0,,I'm Matsunaga Yui, 15, from Fukuoka.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.18,0:26:59.92,Default,Yui,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.34,0:27:01.20,Default,Yui,0,0,0,,Yui-pan!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.90,0:27:05.50,Default,Yui,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.26,0:27:10.63,Default,Yui,0,0,0,,Something that made me laugh recently: yesterday I stayed over with Mii-na,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.70,0:27:13.66,Default,Yui,0,0,0,,and when we did a SHOWROOM stream,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.36,0:27:16.80,Default,Yui,0,0,0,,it turned into a discussion about whether I was eating bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.34,0:27:21.77,Default,Yui,0,0,0,,Then I wondered if Mii-na was eating ramen,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.84,0:27:24.57,Default,Yui,0,0,0,,so I asked her, "Are you eating ramen?"
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.64,0:27:29.38,Default,Yui,0,0,0,,and she shot back so fast, "No, I AM eating it!" kind of thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.78,0:27:30.79,Default,Yui,0,0,0,,that's what she said.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.86,0:27:34.23,Default,Yui,0,0,0,,So when people suspected I was eating bread,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.30,0:27:36.28,Default,Yui,0,0,0,,I realized, "Oh, this is what it feels like,"
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.80,0:27:38.05,Default,Yui,0,0,0,,and it was really funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.12,0:27:39.91,Default,Yui,0,0,0,,Please look after me today.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.98,0:27:42.34,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.61,0:27:47.30,Default,Host,0,0,0,,Okay everyone—please clap along and do the call with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.37,0:27:48.67,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.21,0:27:50.19,Default,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,Se-no!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.59,0:27:53.77,Default,Host,0,0,0,,Sharp Saaya today!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.91,0:27:54.69,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Saaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.23,0:27:55.33,Default,Host,0,0,0,,Coloring your mind — Saaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.43,0:27:56.09,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Saaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.93,0:27:57.46,Default,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,(From Kumamoto — please look after me)
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.53,0:27:58.15,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Ooh~
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.22,0:27:59.17,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,U~~ Saa-ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.73,0:28:04.23,Default,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,I'm Morisaki Saaya from Team KIV, from Kumamoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.77,0:28:05.37,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.03,0:28:10.63,Default,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.39,0:28:15.64,Default,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,Something that made me chuckle: the other day
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.71,0:28:19.12,Default,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,I went to karaoke with Ibuki and Kitagawa Hiiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.19,0:28:21.18,Default,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,We went into a karaoke box,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.25,0:28:25.17,Default,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,and you can order on the touch panel,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.07,0:28:30.88,Default,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,and there were these mic covers available—mic covers.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.95,0:28:33.94,Default,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,They seemed kind of meant for singers,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.01,0:28:37.60,Default,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,sold in packs of two,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.67,0:28:40.53,Default,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,and Ibuki and Hii-chan were like, "Well, we're about to sing,"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.93,0:28:45.72,Default,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,so we ordered them, and we kept singing,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.79,0:28:49.63,Default,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,and when I glanced over they weren't wearing them!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.87,0:28:52.85,Default,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,And…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.11,0:28:53.71,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.27,0:28:57.29,Default,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.51,0:28:59.11,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Maybe they were just hard to sing with?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.09,0:29:02.03,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Wait—
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.10,0:29:04.41,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Wait wait wait, that tracks—wait wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.48,0:29:05.81,Default,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,Maybe because I was there in the room,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.88,0:29:07.00,Default,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,it makes total sense to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.42,0:29:11.25,Default,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,but probably nobody else gets it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.32,0:29:16.35,Default,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,Saaya's story: those mic covers they were supposed to be wearing—
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.42,0:29:18.63,Default,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,both of them went "don't need these!" and yanked them off, and I was like,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.70,0:29:19.89,Default,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,"Ugh, I shouldn't have put one on from the start,"
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.96,0:29:21.66,Default,Host,0,0,0,,Please look after me today.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.10,0:29:23.44,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.81,0:29:27.93,Default,Ii-ko,0,0,0,,My birthday is August 31 — Vegetable Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.55,0:29:29.66,Default,Ii-ko,0,0,0,,What I love is cucumber, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.73,0:29:31.57,Default,Ii-ko,0,0,0,,I'm Tanaka Iori from Kumamoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.91,0:29:33.51,Default,Ii-ko,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.50,0:29:37.10,Default,Host,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.26,0:29:39.79,Default,Ii-ko,0,0,0,,It's not exactly something that made me laugh recently,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.86,0:29:44.37,Default,Ii-ko,0,0,0,,but something that surprised me: on June 13 and 14,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.44,0:29:45.72,Default,Ii-ko,0,0,0,,the Saka Agari show members
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.08,0:29:49.53,Default,Ii-ko,0,0,0,,were announced the other day, right? When I looked at the lineup,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.60,0:29:53.90,Default,Ii-ko,0,0,0,,there were no seniors—Rino and I were the most senior!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.36,0:29:57.70,Default,Ii-ko,0,0,0,,Those two days look so scary, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.32,0:30:02.53,Default,Ii-ko,0,0,0,,I can't even laugh—I'm so nervous already,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.60,0:30:03.99,Default,Ii-ko,0,0,0,,but Nene-san is here today,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.06,0:30:05.84,Default,Ii-ko,0,0,0,,so I want to see lots of Nene-san's expressions.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.32,0:30:07.73,Default,Ii-ko,0,0,0,,Please look after me today.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.80,0:30:09.34,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.71,0:30:13.18,Default,Host,0,0,0,,When I point the mic…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.25,0:30:15.53,Default,Ii-ko,0,0,0,,Please say Magokoro, Seino, and Amiyun together!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.87,0:30:18.57,Default,Ii-ko,0,0,0,,Let's play shiritori!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.30,0:30:22.40,Default,Ii-ko,0,0,0,,Little devil!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.20,0:30:24.11,Default,Ii-ko,0,0,0,,Magokoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.18,0:30:30.68,Default,Ii-ko,0,0,0,,Other lucky girls…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.01,0:30:33.61,Default,Amiyun,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.51,0:30:36.92,Default,Amiyun,0,0,0,,I'm Amiyun—Ishikawa Amiyu—13, from Fukuoka.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.99,0:30:37.80,Default,Amiyun,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.87,0:30:39.21,Default,Amiyun,0,0,0,,Amiyun!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.68,0:30:43.28,Default,Amiyun,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.00,0:30:48.10,Default,Amiyun,0,0,0,,Something that made me laugh a bit recently is about Ikuno-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.66,0:30:52.83,Default,Amiyun,0,0,0,,Ikuno-san and I always message each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.90,0:30:56.34,Default,Amiyun,0,0,0,,and we wanted to try messaging on a different app,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.92,0:31:02.29,Default,Amiyun,0,0,0,,just for a change of pace,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.36,0:31:06.62,Default,Amiyun,0,0,0,,but when we tried another app we struggled for a whole hour,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.32,0:31:10.99,Default,Amiyun,0,0,0,,both of us going "aah aah we can't we can't" the whole time,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.06,0:31:12.90,Default,Amiyun,0,0,0,,like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.92,0:31:15.79,Default,Amiyun,0,0,0,,and I thought, what am I even doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.86,0:31:17.66,Default,Amiyun,0,0,0,,Please look after me today.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.06,0:31:19.80,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.13,0:31:25.41,Default,Amiyun,0,0,0,,When I say "se-no," please answer "Kokoha!"
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.97,0:31:27.94,Default,Kokoha,0,0,0,,Where is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.01,0:31:28.75,Default,Kokoha,0,0,0,,Who am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.93,0:31:30.79,Default,Kokoha,0,0,0,,Se-no — Kokoha!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.45,0:31:32.05,Default,Kokoha,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.47,0:31:35.69,Default,Kokoha,0,0,0,,I'm Fujino Kokoha, 16, a second-year high-school student from Fukuoka.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.06,0:31:40.66,Default,Kokoha,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.36,0:31:45.13,Default,Kokoha,0,0,0,,Something that really got me recently: Eguchi-chan hits my funny bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.20,0:31:49.97,Default,Kokoha,0,0,0,,We'll be talking and if she gets shy she suddenly dances or makes weird faces,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.04,0:31:53.18,Default,Kokoha,0,0,0,,just totally random moves—wait, does she?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.22,0:31:56.35,Default,Kokoha,0,0,0,,That side of her is a bit much,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.42,0:31:58.67,Default,Kokoha,0,0,0,,but I also think it's cute,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.74,0:32:00.39,Default,Kokoha,0,0,0,,so I want to keep getting along.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.46,0:32:01.84,Default,Kokoha,0,0,0,,Please look after me today.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.24,0:32:03.32,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.69,0:32:08.77,Default,Koko,0,0,0,,Okay everyone—please look for Koko!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.43,0:32:10.51,Default,Koko,0,0,0,,Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.79,0:32:14.39,Default,Koko,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.81,0:32:17.28,Default,Koko,0,0,0,,I'm always waiting here, so come see me around here, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.35,0:32:21.24,Default,Koko,0,0,0,,I'm Ko-chan—Eguchi Kokoha—18, a third-year high-school student from Nagasaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.31,0:32:22.25,Default,Koko,0,0,0,,Koko-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.23,0:32:25.83,Default,Koko,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.19,0:32:32.32,Default,Koko,0,0,0,,Something funny that made me laugh recently was about a week ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.39,0:32:36.34,Default,Koko,0,0,0,,After rehearsal I was in the hallway,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.41,0:32:40.58,Default,Koko,0,0,0,,and Ishii-chan came up—I thought she'd say "good work" or something,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.65,0:32:44.26,Default,Koko,0,0,0,,but she asked, "Kokoha-san, how have you been lately?"
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.33,0:32:45.85,Default,Koko,0,0,0,,She asked me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.25,0:32:51.12,Default,Koko,0,0,0,,I get seniors saying that, but a junior saying it for the first time?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.19,0:32:54.40,Default,Koko,0,0,0,,I thought, what a weird kid—and it was funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.47,0:32:55.92,Default,Koko,0,0,0,,Please look after me today.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.99,0:32:58.88,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.42,0:33:02.97,Default,Rino,0,0,0,,Okay—please wake up Sleeping-Forest Princess Rino!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.53,0:33:04.51,Default,Rino,0,0,0,,Wake up, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.23,0:33:05.83,Default,Rino,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.59,0:33:08.26,Default,Rino,0,0,0,,I'm Rino-chan—Sakamoto Rino—from Team H.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.33,0:33:09.33,Default,Rino,0,0,0,,Rino-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.29,0:33:10.89,Default,Rino,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.79,0:33:18.10,Default,Rino,0,0,0,,Something that made me laugh recently: this morning Eguchi-chan
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.17,0:33:21.89,Default,Rino,0,0,0,,grabbed my hand the moment we met,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.43,0:33:24.25,Default,Rino,0,0,0,,and that was a bit heavy for morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.99,0:33:25.74,Default,Rino,0,0,0,,wait a second—
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.81,0:33:28.04,Default,Rino,0,0,0,,it was heavy, but also nice,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.11,0:33:30.29,Default,Rino,0,0,0,,sorry, mornings are a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.87,0:33:32.37,Default,Rino,0,0,0,,Should I have gone for your feet instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.53,0:33:33.65,Default,Rino,0,0,0,,No—anywhere would be too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.39,0:33:35.96,Default,Rino,0,0,0,,That's not the point though.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.03,0:33:38.16,Default,Rino,0,0,0,,People say Ishii-chan's a bit weird,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.23,0:33:41.12,Default,Rino,0,0,0,,but I think she's the weirdest—no I'm kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.19,0:33:43.72,Default,Rino,0,0,0,,Still, I hope we can get closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.79,0:33:44.92,Default,Rino,0,0,0,,Please look after me today, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.99,0:33:46.73,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.30,0:33:48.97,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.04,0:33:53.62,Default,Hina,0,0,0,,Kyuu-tan, Buta-tan, Hina-tan!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.12,0:33:58.05,Default,Hina,0,0,0,,I'm Aoki Hinako from Team KIV—14, a third-year junior-high student from Fukuoka.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.12,0:33:59.16,Default,Hina,0,0,0,,Hina-tan!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.88,0:34:00.48,Default,Hina,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.30,0:34:05.14,Default,Hina,0,0,0,,Something that made Hina laugh recently
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.66,0:34:07.14,Default,Hina,0,0,0,,involves Ayane-chan,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.66,0:34:09.74,Default,Hina,0,0,0,,Ishii Ayane-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.26,0:34:13.25,Default,Hina,0,0,0,,We came by taxi today,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.32,0:34:15.11,Default,Hina,0,0,0,,and riding with us were
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.18,0:34:19.24,Default,Hina,0,0,0,,Rino-san, Rinka, Ishii Ayane-chan, and me,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.80,0:34:21.48,Default,Hina,0,0,0,,and it was pouring rain, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.82,0:34:24.86,Default,Hina,0,0,0,,So Rino-san and Rinka
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.92,0:34:29.68,Default,Hina,0,0,0,,properly used umbrellas and got in the taxi,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.48,0:34:33.28,Default,Hina,0,0,0,,but Ishii Ayane-chan and I absolutely didn't want to use umbrellas,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.66,0:34:36.37,Default,Hina,0,0,0,,it was just a hassle to open them,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.44,0:34:40.24,Default,Hina,0,0,0,,so we waited under shelter until the taxi door opened,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.66,0:34:45.33,Default,Hina,0,0,0,,then planned to dash for it—we were about to dash,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.40,0:34:49.80,Default,Hina,0,0,0,,when the hat I was wearing went WHOOSH and flew off in the wind,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.20,0:34:52.37,Default,Hina,0,0,0,,that hat…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.44,0:34:56.84,Default,Hina,0,0,0,,and that hat landed in a pretty big puddle,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.50,0:34:59.60,Default,Hina,0,0,0,,so Hina's hat is still soaked,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.20,0:35:01.61,Default,Hina,0,0,0,,and I kind of want to fix that,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.68,0:35:03.63,Default,Hina,0,0,0,,but Ishii-chan teases me so much lately,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.70,0:35:06.99,Default,Hina,0,0,0,,and still I was glad she gave me energy from morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.06,0:35:08.51,Default,Hina,0,0,0,,Please look after me today.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.58,0:35:10.21,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.28,0:35:15.72,Default,Hina,0,0,0,,Okay—when I ask a question, answer "Mei-mei," please!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.79,0:35:16.45,Default,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.97,0:35:17.61,Default,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,Mei-mei!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.11,0:35:23.00,Default,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,Melon-loving Mei-mei! Always energetic Mei-mei! Bright smiling…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.07,0:35:24.41,Default,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,Mei-mei! Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.53,0:35:30.34,Default,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,Wrong! Wrong! Wrong! Wrong! Wrong! Wrong! Wrong! Wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.41,0:35:34.54,Default,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,Watch out! Watch out! Saaya passed by! Saaya passed by!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.61,0:35:36.46,Default,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,Bright smiling Mei-mei!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.53,0:35:37.15,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Ooh~
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.22,0:35:43.63,Default,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,Yeah…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.70,0:35:44.30,Default,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.07,0:35:49.17,Default,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,From Yamaguchi, first-year high school,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.24,0:35:51.59,Default,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,16—I'm Mei-mei, Yoshida Mei.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.66,0:35:52.50,Default,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.02,0:35:53.80,Default,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,Mei-mei!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.30,0:35:54.90,Default,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.18,0:36:00.97,Default,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,Something that made me chuckle today:
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.04,0:36:04.83,Default,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,also involving Ishii Ayane-chan—here's what.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.90,0:36:07.65,Default,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,You know that "Masaoka Shiki" bit, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.72,0:36:11.47,Default,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,Amiyun said her shoulder hurt,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.54,0:36:15.55,Default,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,and then Ayane went "kata okashiki? kata okashiki?" like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.62,0:36:18.72,Default,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,and I was like, what is she saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.92,0:36:21.62,Default,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,That is so not landing!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.97,0:36:32.26,Default,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,No wait—Amiyun said her shoulder was weird, so
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.33,0:36:33.89,Default,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,she put it in past tense,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.33,0:36:35.07,Default,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,Past tense?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.21,0:36:39.23,Default,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,and went "kata okashiki"—okay let's stop, enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.71,0:36:41.25,Default,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,let's drop it for today,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.81,0:36:43.15,Default,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,let's stop talking—you tried hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.77,0:36:46.68,Default,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,That's about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.75,0:36:50.19,Default,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,Please look after me today.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.33,0:36:58.00,Default,Nene-chan,0,0,0,,I'm Jitoe Nene from Team KIV, from Miyazaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.07,0:36:58.95,Default,Nene-chan,0,0,0,,Nene-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.67,0:37:02.27,Default,Nene-chan,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.15,0:37:07.48,Default,Nene-chan,0,0,0,,So far a few people talked about who's the weirdest,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.55,0:37:11.37,Default,Nene-chan,0,0,0,,and to me the weirdest is still Kokoha.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.73,0:37:14.15,Default,Nene-chan,0,0,0,,I've told this before, but
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.51,0:37:15.11,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.51,0:37:18.87,Default,Nene-chan,0,0,0,,in one of the songs in this show,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.19,0:37:20.03,Default,Nene-chan,0,0,0,,we all go like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.71,0:37:24.32,Default,Nene-chan,0,0,0,,and when we walk in a straight horizontal line, I looked at the girl in front—
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.39,0:37:26.25,Default,Nene-chan,0,0,0,,and she was walking with the same arm and leg swinging together,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.69,0:37:28.45,Default,Nene-chan,0,0,0,,and who was it? Kokoha.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.01,0:37:31.19,Default,Nene-chan,0,0,0,,I thought she must be nervous,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.51,0:37:33.76,Default,Nene-chan,0,0,0,,so I told her her arm and leg were coming out together,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.83,0:37:37.09,Default,Nene-chan,0,0,0,,and she said, "I have days when I feel like walking that way,"
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.57,0:37:40.25,Default,Nene-chan,0,0,0,,and I thought, wow, that's a real weirdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.05,0:37:42.37,Default,Nene-chan,0,0,0,,Then today,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.75,0:37:45.46,Default,Nene-chan,0,0,0,,in the very first song we all walk out, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.53,0:37:48.85,Default,Nene-chan,0,0,0,,and today she was walking glued right up against someone like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.47,0:37:53.20,Default,Nene-chan,0,0,0,,and I thought, oh, today's one of those mood days—yep, still weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.27,0:37:55.18,Default,Nene-chan,0,0,0,,Please look after me today~
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.25,0:37:56.33,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.65,0:38:02.40,Default,Host,0,0,0,,When I say "super," please answer "Hero!"
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.47,0:38:03.74,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.81,0:38:05.84,Default,Hiiro,0,0,0,,Bright like the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.91,0:38:07.21,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Hakata's super!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.67,0:38:08.50,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.03,0:38:09.63,Default,Hiiro,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.47,0:38:13.60,Default,Hiiro,0,0,0,,I'm Kitagawa Hiiro from Team H, 21, from Fukuoka.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.67,0:38:15.05,Default,Hiiro,0,0,0,,Hero-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.65,0:38:18.25,Default,Hiiro,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.69,0:38:22.56,Default,Hiiro,0,0,0,,Something that made me laugh recently was today's skit.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.63,0:38:27.30,Default,Hiiro,0,0,0,,With 7th-gen Nakano-chan and Yui-pan and me,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.37,0:38:31.48,Default,Hiiro,0,0,0,,we played like part-time workers,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.55,0:38:34.07,Default,Hiiro,0,0,0,,so we were set up as friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.47,0:38:38.16,Default,Hiiro,0,0,0,,and then without hesitation Yui-pan suddenly
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.23,0:38:42.49,Default,Hiiro,0,0,0,,called me "Hii-kopan!" and I was so shocked—wait, you're calling me that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.56,0:38:44.13,Default,Hiiro,0,0,0,,I went "thanks," but
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.20,0:38:49.23,Default,Hiiro,0,0,0,,she hadn't even said beforehand "I'll call you this,"
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.30,0:38:52.97,Default,Hiiro,0,0,0,,she suddenly yelled Hii-kopan, and after several takes
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.04,0:38:56.22,Default,Hiiro,0,0,0,,she asked if she could still call me Hii-kopan in the real show,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.68,0:38:59.49,Default,Hiiro,0,0,0,,and I thought, um, maybe the order is backwards?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.56,0:39:03.03,Default,Hiiro,0,0,0,,Anyway the one who named me that was Izawa Miyu-chan (Zawa-chan),
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.10,0:39:04.91,Default,Hiiro,0,0,0,,and only Zawa-chan calls me Hii-kopan,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.98,0:39:08.31,Default,Hiiro,0,0,0,,so I bet Zawa-chan is secretly happy about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.38,0:39:09.87,Default,Hiiro,0,0,0,,Please look after me today.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.94,0:39:11.53,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.60,0:39:16.37,Default,Karen-ren,0,0,0,,When I say "greedy devil," please answer…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.83,0:39:20.37,Default,Karen-ren,0,0,0,,Karen-ren! The girl who wants to be your angel!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.46,0:39:22.06,Default,Karen-ren,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.56,0:39:25.62,Default,Karen-ren,0,0,0,,I'm Karen-ren—Fukui Karen—18, from Nagasaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.24,0:39:26.86,Default,Karen-ren,0,0,0,,Karen-ren!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.75,0:39:30.35,Default,Karen-ren,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.29,0:39:33.76,Default,Karen-ren,0,0,0,,So, about Nene-nee…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.83,0:39:34.43,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Ehh?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.75,0:39:36.04,Default,Karen-ren,0,0,0,,You're thinking "ehh," right? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.11,0:39:42.18,Default,Karen-ren,0,0,0,,There's a changing area—park where angels are… anyway, the dressing room,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.25,0:39:47.28,Default,Karen-ren,0,0,0,,everyone's dressing spots are different, right? And yet she had a spot—each their own—
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.35,0:39:51.24,Default,Karen-ren,0,0,0,,and Nene-nee was in the dressing room today, in my spot,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.31,0:39:55.37,Default,Karen-ren,0,0,0,,and I thought maybe she really loves me, and I smiled.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.87,0:39:56.47,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Ehh?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.15,0:39:58.55,Default,Karen-ren,0,0,0,,That's scary though.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.43,0:40:03.68,Default,Karen-ren,0,0,0,,Nene-nee… yeah scary. I want to do my best with Nene-nee today too.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.75,0:40:05.65,Default,Karen-ren,0,0,0,,Thank you—please look after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.13,0:40:06.73,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Ehh?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.09,0:40:13.59,Default,Rinka,0,0,0,,Hai, rin…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.87,0:40:14.47,Default,Rinka,0,0,0,,Rin-rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.27,0:40:20.04,Default,Rinka,0,0,0,,Little by little from the small things. My charm point is big sparkling eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.11,0:40:23.98,Default,Rinka,0,0,0,,I'm Ouchi Rinka, 17, a third-year high-school student from Hyogo.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.05,0:40:24.97,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Rinka!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.79,0:40:33.64,Default,Rinka,0,0,0,,Thank you. Something that got me recently is Karen-chan—Karen-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.71,0:40:35.17,Default,Rinka,0,0,0,,Karen-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.87,0:40:39.50,Default,Rinka,0,0,0,,Karen-ren says all kinds of one-liners,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.57,0:40:42.07,Default,Rinka,0,0,0,,and our peers kind of ignore them,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.85,0:40:45.12,Default,Rinka,0,0,0,,and it's become that kind of vibe,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.19,0:40:49.64,Default,Rinka,0,0,0,,but after about three seconds of ignoring, nobody can stand the silence,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.71,0:40:53.48,Default,Rinka,0,0,0,,and everyone bursts out laughing—that's thanks to Karen-chan, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.55,0:40:56.97,Default,Rinka,0,0,0,,Sometimes it's not even funny,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.51,0:41:00.38,Default,Rinka,0,0,0,,but that atmosphere itself can be funny,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.45,0:41:05.01,Default,Rinka,0,0,0,,so I hope Karen-chan keeps talking a lot like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.83,0:41:08.73,Default,Rinka,0,0,0,,Please look after me today, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.29,0:41:15.19,Default,Host,0,0,0,,When I point the mic…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.01,0:41:17.67,Default,Rinka,0,0,0,,Me? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.43,0:41:21.26,Default,Rinka,0,0,0,,Nice—so energetic, really nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.33,0:41:23.89,Default,Host,0,0,0,,When I point the mic: Ayane-ira, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.73,0:41:26.79,Default,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.86,0:41:32.32,Default,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,This Ayane-ira's heart too…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.39,0:41:36.79,Default,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,From Fukuoka… wait, better if I'm not too smart?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.19,0:41:40.91,Default,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,I'm Ishii Ayane—nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.38,0:41:48.04,Default,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,Why is everyone laughing?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.20,0:41:51.68,Default,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,Like "Ayane-ira" then "from Fukuoka" or whatever,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.36,0:41:54.66,Default,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,there was a timing gap—got it, timing gap.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.52,0:41:58.78,Default,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,Something that made me laugh a bit
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.26,0:42:00.51,Default,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,is about Nene-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.58,0:42:01.18,Default,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.46,0:42:03.26,Default,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,Yes, another "again," but
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.18,0:42:05.86,Default,Host,0,0,0,,she kinda skips self-intros a lot,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.36,0:42:10.20,Default,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,I look over this way a lot—stage right? Prompt-side?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.36,0:42:15.32,Default,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,I look that way a lot, and Nene-san catches my eye,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.32,0:42:20.19,Default,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,and her expressions—I've always thought of Nene-san as
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.26,0:42:24.74,Default,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,a cool, grown-up type,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.92,0:42:28.10,Default,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,Could you talk a bit more gathered?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.92,0:42:30.12,Default,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,That's what I thought, but
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.54,0:42:34.39,Default,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,her face is actually really expressive when she's listening,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.46,0:42:37.44,Default,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,like an "ohh" / "nyuu?" kind of face—nyuu?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.50,0:42:39.32,Default,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,while listening,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.02,0:42:44.98,Default,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,and her comebacks go "pasa!" so satisfying,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.54,0:42:48.25,Default,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,so I'm going to keep watching Nene-san a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.32,0:42:50.79,Default,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,Wait that's scary—please look after me today!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.86,0:42:52.90,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.91,0:42:59.24,Default,Host,0,0,0,,HKT48 7th-generation kenkyuusei—wait, wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.31,0:42:59.91,Default,Host,0,0,0,,That's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.05,0:43:06.59,Default,Host,0,0,0,,So we're 7th-gen kenkyuusei too?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.75,0:43:10.13,Default,Host,0,0,0,,Let me start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.63,0:43:15.16,Default,Host,0,0,0,,HKT48 Saka Agari show—presented by these members.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.23,0:43:17.98,Default,Host,0,0,0,,From here, various units will appear.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.05,0:43:18.65,Default,Host,0,0,0,,Please enjoy.

Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.90,1:06:32.44,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,End Roll,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.24,1:06:40.26,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Wagamama na Nagareboshi, Ai no Iro,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.42,1:06:43.38,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Dakishimeraretara, Mushi no Ballad—
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.45,1:06:46.73,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,five songs in a row. Is everyone hyped?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.09,1:06:49.69,Generic,Crowd,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.09,1:06:53.47,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Today Saa-chan was in a new position.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.81,1:06:55.01,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Because the unit songs are coming up.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.65,1:06:58.06,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,It's the unit song End Roll, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.13,1:07:01.55,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,This was my first time doing End Roll.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.93,1:07:04.27,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,It suited you so well.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.71,1:07:06.20,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,It really felt cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.27,1:07:10.49,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,Today I wanted to look a bit cooler to get fired up.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.63,1:07:16.11,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,So I tried cat-eye makeup I don't usually do,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.99,1:07:22.70,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,and I changed my bangs and hair,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.77,1:07:25.49,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,put in a tiny braid,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.03,1:07:27.95,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,stuff like that,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.32,1:07:33.68,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,and I even input some Nene-san vibes,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.80,1:07:37.02,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,and also,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.46,1:07:41.54,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,um, the 7th-gen girls taught me a lot, but
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.62,1:07:46.00,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,Ayane-chan also taught me something,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.18,1:07:46.78,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Ohh.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.85,1:07:49.56,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Was last time your first, Ayane-chan?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.82,1:07:53.06,Generic,Ayane,0,0,0,,Yes. Once—my first End Roll, just that one time.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.20,1:07:53.80,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.88,1:07:57.32,Generic,Ayane,0,0,0,,Just once, and the lesson from that time—
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.64,1:07:58.24,Generic,Ayane,0,0,0,,the takeaway.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.88,1:08:00.26,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,So, “learn from experience,” huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.34,1:08:02.88,Generic,Ayane,0,0,0,,I passed on “learn from experience” to Saa-ya-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.10,1:08:03.70,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Mm.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.77,1:08:04.32,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,What did you tell her?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.40,1:08:09.80,Generic,Ayane,0,0,0,,Um, at the end there's that End Roll pose, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.94,1:08:10.54,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.61,1:08:11.16,Generic,Ayane,0,0,0,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.23,1:08:11.78,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,There is.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.85,1:08:12.40,Generic,Ayane,0,0,0,,Right, and that, somehow,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.47,1:08:17.78,Generic,Ayane,0,0,0,,you're supposed to keep this distance tighter, but
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.18,1:08:21.24,Generic,Ayane,0,0,0,,I was so nervous I ended up like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.48,1:08:22.33,Generic,Ayane,0,0,0,,All spread out.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.40,1:08:23.48,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Ah, it got a bit wide.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.58,1:08:27.68,Generic,Ayane,0,0,0,,Yeah, so they said I looked like a frog stuck to a wall in the rain.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.86,1:08:33.21,Generic,Ayane,0,0,0,,Or like Barrierd from Pokémon—
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.28,1:08:34.22,Generic,Ayane,0,0,0,,I looked like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.58,1:08:35.20,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Like that?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.72,1:08:37.88,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,They really said that.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.02,1:08:44.52,Generic,Ayane,0,0,0,,Yeah. They still say it, so I told Saa-ya-san: watch out for the frog / Barrierd look.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.72,1:08:45.98,Generic,Ayane,0,0,0,,Yeah. That's what I taught her.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.64,1:08:47.34,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.52,1:08:48.40,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,Probably.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.74,1:08:55.24,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,Also Yui-pan, and Minami-chan—senpai, but they taught me too.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.04,1:08:56.64,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,From the juniors, huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.38,1:08:58.34,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Because they're cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.48,1:08:59.24,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Wait, how old are you again?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.54,1:09:01.46,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,Ah, I'm twenty~
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.64,1:09:02.24,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.31,1:09:04.64,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,But the ones who taught you are like middle-schoolers, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.12,1:09:07.23,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Like, ten-something?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.30,1:09:07.98,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Thirteen.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.12,1:09:09.86,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Well, well—everyone's cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.16,1:09:11.03,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,You all pulled it off.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.10,1:09:11.70,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.12,1:09:12.92,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Glad it went well.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.24,1:09:14.42,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.74,1:09:15.44,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,Eh, but, like…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.58,1:09:16.18,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.56,1:09:17.40,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.50,1:09:18.32,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,I thought it was good.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.52,1:09:21.47,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Kokoha's End Roll is kinda kabuki-like, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.54,1:09:22.14,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.30,1:09:23.26,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,In the choreography.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.46,1:09:25.00,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,There's moves like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.14,1:09:25.54,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.62,1:09:26.22,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,There are.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.29,1:09:31.84,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,I did it thinking I looked so cool—then my gen-mates said, “That was kabuki.”
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.74,1:09:33.14,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.22,1:09:33.70,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,Like, “huh?”
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.77,1:09:34.32,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.39,1:09:34.94,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.01,1:09:35.41,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Kabuki is hard.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.49,1:09:35.96,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.04,1:09:36.79,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Because it's hard.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.86,1:09:38.15,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,From here on, let's all keep working at it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.22,1:09:39.01,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Let's go, for real.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.08,1:09:39.68,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,The dancing, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.92,1:09:46.15,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,Still on units—today I did Wagamama na Nagareboshi for the first time, with 7th-gen Amiyun.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.22,1:09:51.23,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,And the skit bits, the final “hana” bit—you planned stuff backstage, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.30,1:09:53.03,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,I heard a little rumor.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.10,1:09:58.85,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,Yes. In rehearsal I got to do Ai no Iro with Kokoha-san this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.92,1:09:59.60,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,That's a favorite, huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.70,1:10:00.33,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,Wagamama…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.40,1:10:05.16,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,I got to do a favorite song, but during the skit, at the end—what did I say again?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.70,1:10:08.14,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,What was it—like a “puu~” cutesy pose, I went “puu~.”
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.34,1:10:11.50,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,When I said that at the end, Kokoha-san snorted—
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.76,1:10:14.68,Generic,Kokoha,0,0,0,,I diiid.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.85,1:10:19.61,Generic,Kokoha,0,0,0,,I mean, why the sudden cutesy act~
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.21,1:10:21.17,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,For the flow.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.31,1:10:21.91,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.99,1:10:22.83,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,So… it was funny?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.97,1:10:24.93,Generic,Kokoha,0,0,0,,Hmm, a bit—yeah, it was funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.07,1:10:25.67,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.25,1:10:32.75,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,I was shocked—right before going on, I heard the skit, and a loud “hmph!” snort.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.45,1:10:34.51,Generic,Kokoha,0,0,0,,Did I say that?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.61,1:10:35.68,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,It echoed, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.75,1:10:37.05,Generic,Kokoha,0,0,0,,Ehh, that's a little embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.37,1:10:38.89,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,That was you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.97,1:10:40.47,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,I was a little impressed, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.69,1:10:42.87,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,That skit—Amiyun made it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.91,1:10:46.71,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,So yeah—no snorting through your nose.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.87,1:10:48.21,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,It was seriously funny, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.77,1:10:51.27,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,So funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.03,1:10:52.83,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,A bit, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.11,1:10:54.21,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,You were teasing her.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.61,1:10:55.25,Generic,Kokoha,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.39,1:10:56.28,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Oh, okay then, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.35,1:10:56.95,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,All good.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.02,1:10:57.99,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Something like that, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.21,1:10:59.85,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,So the story is: it was fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.11,1:11:02.93,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,On that “it was fun” note—chan-chan—let's wrap this up.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.43,1:11:09.11,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,The second half keeps going—are you ready to get even more hyped?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.35,1:11:10.71,Generic,Crowd,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.39,1:11:14.67,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Thank you! The second half starts with this song. Please enjoy.

Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.71,1:25:27.09,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Sorry — that fell, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.73,1:25:31.87,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.41,1:25:33.01,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.77,1:25:40.13,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Alright, let's chat with this lineup.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.20,1:25:41.54,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Let's have fun!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.94,1:25:47.42,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,So, about that…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.21,1:25:53.88,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,It felt new. Today I was in the skit.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.46,1:26:00.43,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,With the skit, since members do it every week, there's a lot to think through.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.50,1:26:06.13,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Today's cast was me, Nene-san, Hiiro-chan… and who else was it? Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.20,1:26:09.88,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Poor Yui-pan…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.80,1:26:15.36,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,It was Minami-chan, huh. So then,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.88,1:26:19.96,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,I was wondering what to do, and we went with a bakery setting.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.80,1:26:25.93,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Once it was a bakery, they said it's because Yui-pan loves bread, and uh,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.00,1:26:31.36,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,by the dressing-room door there were tons of paper-craft breads.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.88,1:26:32.53,Generic,Crowd,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.60,1:26:34.20,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,They weren't made for personal fun—
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.96,1:26:36.96,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,They were for Nene's sketch. Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.67,1:26:42.35,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,So she wasn't just making bread as a hobby. Ah, I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.02,1:26:49.39,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,I thought it was a hobby — like she loved bread so much she made them. But it was for the sketch.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.46,1:26:54.43,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Oh. I wanted a bit where I eat them, so
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.50,1:27:00.75,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,I was carefully cutting a melon-pan — then Nene-san got surprisingly strict.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.82,1:27:04.44,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Like, "You should cut the slits more like this."
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.22,1:27:08.80,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,I was all, "Okay, okay…"
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.42,1:27:15.65,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Chop-chop-chop — I was covered in paper scraps sitting there. She cuts with zero hesitation.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.72,1:27:18.47,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,And it was five minutes before curtain!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.54,1:27:19.14,Generic,Crowd,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.68,1:27:22.74,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Thanks, Yui-pan. Glad it worked out.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.88,1:27:27.99,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,But Rino-chan seems fearless, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.06,1:27:33.34,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Today's sketch was apparently really scary — I got a LINE for about the first time.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.60,1:27:40.15,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,What'd it say? Um… she checked the rundown and saw she was next after Nene-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.22,1:27:46.15,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,So she thought she'd tell Nene: "Nene-san, tomorrow's sketch is a bit scary…"
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.22,1:27:51.91,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,You get it, right? LINE came, and in the end it was like, "Okay — I'll go for it cheerfully!"
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.98,1:27:56.43,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,She decided to say it brightly, and somehow it worked out.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.50,1:28:00.02,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Thanks, everyone — it was fun!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.12,1:28:04.39,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Kind of like the shop went under?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.46,1:28:09.02,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Yeah, we totally wrecked it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.80,1:28:14.85,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Totally different topic — at the last show, a bit before,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.92,1:28:20.85,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,there was a suspicion the 7th gens were copying the 6th gens' self-intros.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.92,1:28:22.68,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,And she turned into a little devil.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.12,1:28:28.35,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Mei-mei isn't here, right? Earlier Mei-mei was going "uu~ Mei-mei".
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.42,1:28:29.02,Generic,Crowd,0,0,0,,Ehh?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.09,1:28:29.96,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,She was!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.42,1:28:36.78,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,When I was there, I stubbornly did not do the "uu~". Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.16,1:28:40.08,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,But when Saa-chan melted, she immediately went "uu~ Mei-mei".
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.34,1:28:42.60,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,That's copying!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.60,1:28:48.30,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,But Mei-mei already said it — and our side was saying it too.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.88,1:28:51.78,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,So we're the bad guys. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.50,1:28:58.80,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Sorry-sorry, our bad. But it looks like Mei-mei said it herself, when actually—
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.92,1:29:04.32,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Originally Nene-san whispered "uu~" quietly. Did she? Dunno.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.58,1:29:07.54,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,She did. Scary, scary. She did. She really did.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.90,1:29:12.59,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Yeah… I messed that up a bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.95,1:29:15.77,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Way too wrong. It was Nene-san, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.19,1:29:18.71,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Right. But it was actually pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.21,1:29:23.41,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,I even thought, maybe this version's nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.79,1:29:24.79,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,The original one. It was cute.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.45,1:29:30.61,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,But Isshi also said this looks like Saa-chan's self-intro. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.71,1:29:35.62,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Which one was it? I do this "Ayane iro" gesture, but
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.69,1:29:39.35,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Saa-chan's starts with tan-tan-tan-tan, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.73,1:29:43.27,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,The hand is similar — "please do something about it!"
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.01,1:29:48.20,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Ours. Wait — no, ours looks similar.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.27,1:29:51.53,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Why is the later one hanging her head? This side.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.95,1:29:53.05,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Okay Isshi — open palm?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.47,1:29:55.09,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Open palm. Like a conductor.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.35,1:29:55.95,Generic,Crowd,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.02,1:29:59.39,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Saa-chan, what do you do? Se-no — go. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.87,1:30:02.71,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Palm or peace?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.23,1:30:04.17,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Peace.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.05,1:30:09.51,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Then let's do this from next time. Wait, for real? Is that okay? I dunno.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.15,1:30:11.75,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,So this is fine?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.03,1:30:15.31,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,The 7th-gen girls' intros keep changing. This too.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.81,1:30:19.65,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Really. Same as Rocky. I didn't mean to copy, but
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.13,1:30:24.17,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Catchphrases stick in your head so easily, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.51,1:30:26.73,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,So you naturally end up similar.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.27,1:30:29.59,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,So you did copy? That means…?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.13,1:30:31.91,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.99,1:30:37.65,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,For Mei-mei, the little-devil part, yeah that's true. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.07,1:30:38.67,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Not like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.23,1:30:40.95,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,We didn't copy. We didn't, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.23,1:30:42.15,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Didn't copy.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.22,1:30:48.56,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Come on — for Mei-mei the rhythm is similar, sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.90,1:30:51.60,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,But this one is straight-up the gesture.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.94,1:30:52.88,Generic,Crowd,0,0,0,,True. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.64,1:30:54.30,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Unforgivable?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.86,1:30:56.10,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Double copy, huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.44,1:30:57.04,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Double copy.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.26,1:31:03.57,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,She seemed unforgiving. But flip it — Saa-chan's catchphrase is beloved.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.64,1:31:05.34,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Easy to burn into your brain. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.84,1:31:06.44,Generic,Crowd,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.51,1:31:07.44,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,She's kind of complimenting us.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.82,1:31:11.02,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Complimenting — then slowly making it her own.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.00,1:31:15.36,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Fine. Let's keep shining as Iro together. Right?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.00,1:31:16.68,Generic,Crowd,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.10,1:31:22.36,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,There was something, right — Iro something. Hiiro too? Yeah, I'm kinda one too. Where'd that go?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.54,1:31:28.79,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,It wasn't a thing? Me? Wasn't there an "Iro something-zu"? Something-zu.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.86,1:31:32.04,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Originally Sayamaru-san and Oda-san
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.72,1:31:39.11,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,called up the Iro Sisters and let us join. Saya. The two of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.18,1:31:45.13,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,And when they graduated they said, if a new Iro kid joins someday,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.20,1:31:49.32,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,let her in — and yet here we are getting called copycats.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.34,1:31:52.18,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Be a little nicer, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.69,1:31:53.29,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.17,1:31:55.29,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Get along!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.97,1:32:00.39,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Let's all keep copying in harmony!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.46,1:32:05.76,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Next up: the second-half group. Congrats! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.90,1:32:13.74,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,We'll chat with this second-half lineup — first, Nakano-chan.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.92,1:32:14.52,Generic,Crowd,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.59,1:32:17.94,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,I have a story about Yasui Hina-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.94,1:32:22.42,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,Lately Hina-san's been all tsun-tsun with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.58,1:32:24.22,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.48,1:32:28.78,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,Like how? The other day we did Koko ni Datte Tenshi wa Iru together, and
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.90,1:32:32.46,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,we've been understudying Mokugekisha together a lot lately, and
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.62,1:32:37.43,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,then Hina-san goes like this and gives me a big hug. From Hina-tan.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.50,1:32:42.21,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,So I said, "So you like me, huh?" And then
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.28,1:32:47.26,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,"No — I hug people I hate." "You hug people you hate?!" Scary scary scary.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.76,1:32:53.17,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,Why? Then the other day Mei-mei was there too, and she hugged Mei-mei, so
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.24,1:32:59.52,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,I said, "So you hate Mei-mei?" And she went, "Wait, now I hug people I like?"
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.72,1:33:00.86,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,Kind of sorry…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.12,1:33:01.72,Generic,Crowd,0,0,0,,Cute.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.79,1:33:07.52,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,Ultimate tsundere. Coming at me all tsun-tsun like that. Why? Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.82,1:33:09.02,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,I wonder…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.22,1:33:12.54,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,Did I even do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.28,1:33:14.88,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,Unaware of it?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.18,1:33:19.08,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,An unaware tsundere? Wait — Hina's a tsundere?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.42,1:33:21.04,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,Unaware, yeah. Totally unaware.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.80,1:33:22.40,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,But…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.42,1:33:24.30,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,I like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.06,1:33:27.44,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,Uh… (awkward)…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.96,1:33:31.00,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,This is awkward — can we drop this? Let's end it.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.88,1:33:32.48,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,Okay then…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.72,1:33:33.54,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,Iori-san, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.78,1:33:36.06,Generic,Iori,0,0,0,,Right — I have a Mei-mei story.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.52,1:33:41.54,Generic,Iori,0,0,0,,Mei-chan. Today every time Mei-mei looks at my face she sparkle-sparkle laughs.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.78,1:33:43.58,Generic,Iori,0,0,0,,You know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.92,1:33:44.97,Generic,Iori,0,0,0,,Why, why?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.04,1:33:45.64,Generic,Crowd,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.71,1:33:47.34,Generic,Iori,0,0,0,,True — was there something on Iori's face?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.14,1:33:50.22,Generic,Iori,0,0,0,,No, that's not it,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.80,1:33:51.40,Generic,Iori,0,0,0,,um,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.76,1:33:57.34,Generic,Iori,0,0,0,,when I looked, she was watching me, saying nothing, so I wondered why she was staring.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.80,1:34:03.10,Generic,Iori,0,0,0,,If you were watching each other, did you want her to talk to you, Iori?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.46,1:34:05.20,Generic,Iori,0,0,0,,You mean I wanted her to talk to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.76,1:34:07.10,Generic,Iori,0,0,0,,So that's it? …Doesn't seem like that's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.62,1:34:12.80,Generic,Iori,0,0,0,,No no. Not that. But I really want to talk with her. So today she laughed so hard,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.90,1:34:14.61,Generic,Iori,0,0,0,,I thought I'd use this as a chance to say hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.68,1:34:15.28,Generic,Crowd,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.66,1:34:21.88,Generic,Iori,0,0,0,,Now's the time. Great chance. But before the show, just from eye contact,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.96,1:34:23.14,Generic,Iori,0,0,0,,see — she's laughing right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.54,1:34:25.02,Generic,Iori,0,0,0,,So much. We don't usually lock eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.30,1:34:30.81,Generic,Iori,0,0,0,,And I thought it'd be a second — then she laughed like 30 seconds, sparkle the whole time. Scary. Actually,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.88,1:34:36.73,Generic,Iori,0,0,0,,there's a reason. When Kokoha-san was writing on the board,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.80,1:34:42.41,Generic,Iori,0,0,0,,she pulled a weird face. That face stuck in my head, and every time I see Kokoha-san,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.48,1:34:43.64,Generic,Iori,0,0,0,,I remember the weird face.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.18,1:34:45.06,Generic,Iori,0,0,0,,That's the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.44,1:34:46.04,Generic,Iori,0,0,0,,Weird face.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.23,1:34:50.35,Generic,Iori,0,0,0,,And her laugh is funny too — not a polite "hee," more like "guheh-guheh."
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.13,1:34:53.93,Generic,Iori,0,0,0,,Like that. Kind of a clumsy laugh.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.21,1:34:54.81,Generic,Iori,0,0,0,,Um,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.88,1:34:59.33,Generic,Hina-tan,0,0,0,,I was with Mei-mei once too, walking together,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.43,1:35:05.01,Generic,Hina-tan,0,0,0,,our way home lined up a bit — she was laughing like "fufuu~" then,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.29,1:35:05.89,Generic,Hina-tan,0,0,0,,um,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.25,1:35:10.89,Generic,Hina-tan,0,0,0,,like Eguchi said, she's got another weird laugh — a devilish one,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.89,1:35:13.49,Generic,Hina-tan,0,0,0,,Ehh?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.10,1:35:15.58,Generic,Hina-tan,0,0,0,,I don't think I've heard that.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.96,1:35:16.56,Generic,Hina-tan,0,0,0,,Wait,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.74,1:35:22.00,Generic,Hina-tan,0,0,0,,Even as her gen-mate I haven't heard that weird laugh. Ehh — I don't! I don't?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.50,1:35:24.00,Generic,Hina-tan,0,0,0,,Then it's unconscious. This one's unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.32,1:35:24.92,Generic,Hina-tan,0,0,0,,Ehh?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.12,1:35:26.26,Generic,Hina-tan,0,0,0,,I wanna hear that.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.90,1:35:28.68,Generic,Hina-tan,0,0,0,,Well then — maybe more weird faces?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.12,1:35:35.50,Generic,Hina-tan,0,0,0,,Do a weird face! Maybe more will bring it out. Wait — you were making faces alone at the board? My face is just naturally weird, so—
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.94,1:35:36.62,Generic,Crowd,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.96,1:35:44.00,Generic,Hina-tan,0,0,0,,But when your eyes meet a kouhai, you panic, right? That was me,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.10,1:35:44.70,Generic,Crowd,0,0,0,,Mm.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.77,1:35:47.60,Generic,Hina-tan,0,0,0,,So I thought a weird face might break the ice — then she laughed way harder than expected,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.72,1:35:48.32,Generic,Crowd,0,0,0,,Mm.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.39,1:35:52.60,Generic,Hina-tan,0,0,0,,For a long time — see, still laughing — sorry,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.98,1:35:55.18,Generic,Hina-tan,0,0,0,,Fun, though. That was fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.92,1:35:58.12,Generic,Hina-tan,0,0,0,,What a story — funny, nanaki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.68,1:36:04.94,Generic,Rinka,0,0,0,,I've got a story too. What? Well, I'm the self-styled azatoi police.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.64,1:36:10.62,Generic,Rinka,0,0,0,,Here we've got about two azatoi people, I think.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.12,1:36:11.72,Generic,Rinka,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.92,1:36:12.92,Generic,Rinka,0,0,0,,Iori-san, and
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.54,1:36:19.68,Generic,Rinka,0,0,0,,Eguchi Koko-chan. Yeah yeah. The day before yesterday I went to dinner with Egu-chan,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.10,1:36:26.19,Generic,Rinka,0,0,0,,you eat, right, and say "delicious" like this — I told you before — fist clenched like this,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.26,1:36:27.54,Generic,Rinka,0,0,0,,Did you already tell that as a premise?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.96,1:36:34.01,Generic,Rinka,0,0,0,,Embarrassing. Same premise, but I heard a new azatoi bit. Like, really,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.08,1:36:39.82,Generic,Rinka,0,0,0,,she'll say "…but it's delicious," then "Today was fun, huh,"
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.94,1:36:42.58,Generic,Rinka,0,0,0,,and she sticks a little "chii~" on everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.86,1:36:45.62,Default,Rinka,0,0,0,,I mean — enough with the chii-chii already!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.32,1:36:59.43,Generic,Rinka,0,0,0,,I was like "she's so extra," and I wondered if 7th gens have azatoi kids too.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.50,1:37:01.34,Generic,Rinka,0,0,0,,True — I'm curious. So curious.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.66,1:37:02.26,Generic,Rinka,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.60,1:37:07.10,Generic,Rinka,0,0,0,,Ehhh — I don't really have that image…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.68,1:37:10.22,Generic,Rinka,0,0,0,,But Ishii Ayane — she's azatoi. Ahh,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.94,1:37:12.86,Generic,Rinka,0,0,0,,I can see that. She is azatoi.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.36,1:37:14.52,Generic,Rinka,0,0,0,,Not just weird?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.76,1:37:15.36,Generic,Crowd,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.43,1:37:15.98,Generic,Rinka,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.05,1:37:21.73,Generic,Rinka,0,0,0,,She's weird sometimes and azatoi sometimes — and when she appeals to fans she goes "Kyaa!"
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.80,1:37:22.64,Generic,Rinka,0,0,0,,like that,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.18,1:37:23.78,Generic,Crowd,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.96,1:37:26.42,Generic,Rinka,0,0,0,,I'm thinking, you don't always do that!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.90,1:37:29.78,Generic,Rinka,0,0,0,,Ah, I see. The police in me almost activated,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.50,1:37:31.46,Generic,Rinka,0,0,0,,so I'll try to hold it in.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.10,1:37:36.60,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Fun! Anyway, that's our chat — next is the last song.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.13,1:37:39.03,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Please come out.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.34,1:37:50.30,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,And now, please listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.80,1:37:51.62,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Fan Letter.

Dialogue: 0,1:56:06.29,1:56:07.62,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Fugiri, Hanpa na Ikemen—
Dialogue: 0,1:56:07.69,1:56:09.10,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,two songs in a row.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:09.17,1:56:10.67,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Thank you all for the encore!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:11.81,1:56:12.71,Generic,Crowd,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:18.41,1:56:21.27,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,I'd like to hear what the members thought—
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.63,1:56:22.25,Generic,Nene,0,0,0,,Fujikoko
Dialogue: 0,1:56:22.69,1:56:23.29,Generic,Kokoha,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:24.64,1:56:25.29,Generic,Kokoha,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:25.36,1:56:28.77,Generic,Kokoha,0,0,0,,Today's the eve of my birthday!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:28.84,1:56:29.83,Generic,Nene,0,0,0,,No it isn't!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:29.90,1:56:31.91,Generic,Members,0,0,0,,No it isn't!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:31.98,1:56:32.82,Generic,Kokoha,0,0,0,,It is—thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:33.62,1:56:36.20,Generic,Kokoha,0,0,0,,Tomorrow's my birthday—I turn 17—
Dialogue: 0,1:56:36.66,1:56:38.53,Generic,Kokoha,0,0,0,,and 17 feels a little more grown-up, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:38.60,1:56:40.22,Generic,Kokoha,0,0,0,,So from here on I want to be
Dialogue: 0,1:56:40.80,1:56:42.29,Generic,Kokoha,0,0,0,,a little more mature.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:42.36,1:56:44.16,Generic,Kokoha,0,0,0,,Thank you for today!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:47.55,1:56:50.59,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Before Kokoha's birthday, next up is Mei-mei's birthday festival—
Dialogue: 0,1:56:51.37,1:56:54.31,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,so please give her a huge celebration!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:57.32,1:56:58.22,Generic,Crowd,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:58.50,1:57:01.18,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,And now—this really is the last song.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:03.63,1:57:05.53,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Everyone—ready to yell for the finale?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:07.25,1:57:08.43,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Ready to get hyped?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:09.81,1:57:10.71,Generic,Crowd,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:10.99,1:57:11.90,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Please listen to—
Dialogue: 0,1:57:11.97,1:57:12.97,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,To be continued.

Dialogue: 0,2:05:38.93,2:05:40.26,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,That's the show!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:40.33,2:05:40.93,Generic,Crowd,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:41.00,2:05:41.95,Generic,Crowd,0,0,0,,Yay~!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:42.81,2:05:45.53,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Today was Kokoha's birthday-eve celebration—
Dialogue: 0,2:05:46.23,2:05:47.05,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,how was it?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:47.15,2:05:49.44,Generic,Kokoha,0,0,0,,I thought there'd never be a day this happy—
Dialogue: 0,2:05:49.51,2:05:50.87,Generic,Kokoha,0,0,0,,it was so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:50.99,2:05:52.20,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Really? That's great!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:52.27,2:05:53.95,Generic,Kokoha,0,0,0,,Everyone cheering for me…
Dialogue: 0,2:05:54.13,2:05:55.41,Generic,Kokoha,0,0,0,,everyone was in tears.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:56.25,2:05:57.30,Generic,Kokoha,0,0,0,,I was so happy.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:57.37,2:05:58.86,Generic,Kokoha,0,0,0,,No scene like that, though.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:58.93,2:06:00.13,Generic,Members,0,0,0,,Good work today!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:00.45,2:06:02.17,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Saa-chan too—End Roll.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:02.41,2:06:05.25,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,Right—I go in from the look,
Dialogue: 0,2:06:05.35,2:06:08.38,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,so today, with the cat eyes and the hair,
Dialogue: 0,2:06:08.45,2:06:09.79,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,I really piled it on,
Dialogue: 0,2:06:10.21,2:06:12.99,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,and I inputted some Nene-san,
Dialogue: 0,2:06:13.09,2:06:13.69,Generic,Nene,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:13.76,2:06:14.39,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:14.46,2:06:15.80,Generic,Nene,0,0,0,,Collateral damage!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:15.87,2:06:17.43,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,That's fine, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:18.07,2:06:18.83,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:19.13,2:06:21.59,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,I don't really have another topic, but—
Dialogue: 0,2:06:22.81,2:06:24.90,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,we also had a show yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,2:06:24.97,2:06:27.43,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,and we really gave it everything,
Dialogue: 0,2:06:27.71,2:06:29.13,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,0,,Please watch if you can.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:29.33,2:06:31.41,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Up next is Mei-mei's birthday celebration,
Dialogue: 0,2:06:31.89,2:06:34.55,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,and I think it'll top Kokoha's birthday eve,
Dialogue: 0,2:06:35.77,2:06:36.37,Generic,Members,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:36.44,2:06:37.48,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Though it's not Kokoha's birthday yet.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:37.55,2:06:38.15,Generic,Kokoha,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:38.29,2:06:39.59,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Please do watch, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:39.79,2:06:40.55,Generic,Members,0,0,0,,See you!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:40.75,2:06:41.35,Generic,Members,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
